{"actions":[],"cardId":"cardid_b6a26f756709da32804e60fd462a1101","createdAt":"2026-03-14T01:05:22Z","expiresAt":"2026-03-16T01:05:22Z","icon":"square.grid.2x2","id":"card_f9094976bafee62ef59377e6f2c4c85c","message":"A quiet Saturday but the world didn't stop overnight. Three threads worth tracking.","metadata":{"height":560,"htmlContent":"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><meta name='color-scheme' content='light dark'><style>:root{--bg:var(--fw-bg,#ffffff);--text:var(--fw-text,#111827);--muted:var(--fw-text-secondary,#6b7280);--tertiary:var(--fw-text-tertiary,#9ca3af);--border:var(--fw-border,rgba(15,23,42,0.08));--accent:var(--fw-accent,#2563eb);--surface:var(--fw-surface,#f3f4f6)}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:var(--fw-bg,#1c1c1e);--text:var(--fw-text,#f2f2f7);--muted:var(--fw-text-secondary,#a0a0a0);--tertiary:var(--fw-text-tertiary,#707070);--border:var(--fw-border,rgba(255,255,255,0.1));--accent:var(--fw-accent,#4b93ff);--surface:var(--fw-surface,#2a2a2a)}}body{margin:0;padding:20px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg)}*{box-sizing:border-box}h4{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3}.subtitle{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.4}.msg{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.4}.divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:0}.date{font-size:13px;color:var(--tertiary);margin:0 0 12px}.story{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:14px 0}.story-text{flex:1;min-width:0}.story-headline{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 4px}.story-summary{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px}.story-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--tertiary)}.story-category{background:var(--border);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.03em}.story-img{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--border);flex-shrink:0}</style></head><body><div class='date'>Mar 14 Saturday · π Day</div><h4>Hormuz crisis widens, China wins BCI race, your meta-article shipped</h4><div class='subtitle'>A quiet Saturday but the world didn’t stop overnight. Three threads worth tracking.</div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Hormuz conflict spills into the Indian Ocean</div><div class='story-summary'>Drones struck Oman’s Duqm port and Salalah, damaging fuel storage. Iran allowed select Turkish and Indian ships through the strait on Mar 13, but insurance withdrawal keeps most tankers frozen. Shadow-fleet vessels now make up half of all Hormuz transits.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Geopolitics</span><span>· Chatham House / USNI</span></div></div></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>China approves world’s first invasive BCI for clinical use</div><div class='story-summary'>Neuracle Medical’s NEO system restores hand function for quadriplegic patients via semi-invasive epidural electrodes. BCI stocks surged 10%+ on Chinese exchanges. Neuralink is still in trials.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Tech</span><span>· FreshFromChina · Mar 13</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://abit.ee/images/neuracle-bci-brain-computer-interface-china-nmpa-neuralink-neurotechnology-2026-01.webp' alt='BCI' onerror=\"this.style.background='var(--surface)';this.alt='';this.onerror=null\"></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Task-factory article published — 6.4 → 8.56 in 4 rounds</div><div class='story-summary'>23 subagents, 5 critics, ethics scored highest at 8.8. The piece documents every stage of your 11-day journey from single AI tasks to recursive factory-of-factories. Mic research from last night still needs a follow-up.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Your work</span><span>· Last night</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555949963-aa79dcee981c?w=160&h=160&fit=crop' alt='Code' onerror=\"this.style.background='var(--surface)';this.alt='';this.onerror=null\"></div></body></html>"},"priority":"medium","state":"active","subType":"briefing","subtitle":"Hormuz crisis spills into the Indian Ocean, China wins the BCI race, and your task-factory article shipped at 8.56","timestamp":"2026-03-14T01:05:22Z","title":"Saturday briefing","type":"html-webview"}
